{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07556","headline":"尚书都堂瓦松 · 李华","name":"尚书都堂瓦松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华省秘仙踪，高堂露瓦松。\n叶因春後长，花爲雨来浓。\n影混鸳鸯色，光含翡翠容。\n天然斯所寄，地势太无从。\n接栋临双阙，连甍近九重。\n宁知深涧底，霜雪岁兼封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}